msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It was the spring of my "
"fourteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Era la primavera del mio "
"quattordicesimo anno."

#: scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc9e1fb7ceb664fedec5e4b863e74380c069770d00f8ceff6d3cd8b045c6335e
#. default-sha256: 5df18919b0abc6dc372cc782b907c0f0a748801a51ac807fb03314bca3ecc7b3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, for one, preferred it when the sun ⟪k:1⟫wasn’t⟪k:2⟫ out.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Not that sunlight would "
"kill me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Io personalmente, preferivo quando il sole ⟪k:1⟫non c’era⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non che la luce mi "
"avrebbe uccisa,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 929052a819875b195eb630b93bb08a90adfa552bb960f901992c86aa72ac3cf9
#. default-sha256: eff6da763e64b59ac73cd5b3fe70f361e2633513725c1aa1ef072968f972f073
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but if it was bright enough, the whole world was so white I could hardly see a thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma se fosse stata troppo intensa, il mondo intero sarebbe diventato così bianco da non farmi "
"vedere più niente."

#: scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55e4905968cbbc30a99a1cdf20ad23af4f8a286e72181b90fc44a509514702ca
