msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’mon, Michelle. Don’t tell me you forgot what to do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avanti, Michelle. Non dirmi che hai dimenticato cosa fare...?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0ABF3D8_62DB_4464_816B_9A78E4EBECBA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cee84c48899fc26c4e28242e9bf44d0abc917f993beadf5ca7113f9eaa0c615f
#. default-sha256: ff2bfaded0c60f3facfb67d4441b541dd5e6a21642ba7885bba47be5cfa1765d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0ABF3D8_62DB_4464_816B_9A78E4EBECBA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was to present my hand to the man—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫for him to kiss."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dovevo offrire la mia mano all’uomo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫affinché lui la baciasse."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 276eb90abe1b1ffa500fa76422c4e3f6ebe287d900e2ee50629ada674fa3a95f
#. default-sha256: 724312dcb75107613a27a58aaa87ec3c4014033652294f45593f404c277f8d41
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why? Why was ⟪k:1⟫this⟪k:2⟫ a traditional greeting?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why did I have to go through "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perché? Perché doveva essere ⟪k:1⟫quello⟪k:2⟫ il saluto abituale?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Perché dovevo "
"affrontare una cosa simile?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c8af5eafab3d88a28666982c3e14ae92eace3af37b12f8f25e01ed78748763f
#. default-sha256: 7d5fc16830810fd9a989a51ec4625ca3b5e0da541ce732c440f9888b10ef3093
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man kneeling before me gave an uncomfortable chuckle at my reluctance, shrugged, and "
"reverently took my hand in his."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’uomo inginocchiato sorrise con imbarazzo dinanzi alla mia riluttanza, scrollò le spalle, e "
"con riverenza prese la mia mano."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 178dae883738b0fe2359125a676eb714a19d261d51eaf12e4d8138c81a96bddf
#. default-sha256: 7ea3048cdc918dbe818246943ccc956f22138f07b1b03e9532ffb609c895031b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Reflexively, I smacked the man’s hand away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Georges’s eyes went wide in horror, and "
"the man gave another playful shrug."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫D’istinto, scansai via la mano dell’uomo.⟪k:1⟫ Georges spalancò gli occhi per il terrore, e "
"l’uomo scrollò nuovamente le spalle con fare beffardo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_89FCADE7_D03C_44B4_B9EF_0C5B1D796B37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36d07a8a7f894da3de53fdda47a3f7b06e1dc33419e6eb95dec920df44cc83cc
#. default-sha256: 5a870691c60ed9aaab5971739be69853af40bfe39c9f90d193e094375f2f05d2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89FCADE7_D03C_44B4_B9EF_0C5B1D796B37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was half a second away from throwing a barrage of insults, but I bit my tongue and stomped "
"off instead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero sul punto di lanciare una raffica di insulti, ma tenni a freno la lingua e me ne andai "
"via."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FC99BFE_F6FB_4B24_8258_E8925D85909E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 576b0ef603936d9db1e88de44bae511a723ae93a4b45152824ad8e95678fdd56
#. default-sha256: 4a8b352f20bfb627e37fd161f4901fd3cb69c137d1e0256a2e54e81aa80d34a6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FC99BFE_F6FB_4B24_8258_E8925D85909E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had spent all that time convincing myself I couldn’t humiliate my brothers, but now, I "
"wouldn’t hear a word of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avevo passato tutto il tempo a convincermi che non avrei dovuto umiliare i miei fratelli, "
"però in quel momento, non volevo saperne⟪k:1⟫più niente."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A60071E_1925_4AB7_9C8E_54096F8FD1DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d38652a313df4b1d1108e2643e3ffdb0d0d5553974574fd335de49608cb608c
#. default-sha256: d6db77d95ccad723636d364b969fbb523344af4edf216fe00e3589c1b64ed0bb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A60071E_1925_4AB7_9C8E_54096F8FD1DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say, practically swiping a glass of water off a passing waiter’s tray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dissi, sgraffignando un bicchiere d’acqua dal vassoio di un cameriere di passaggio."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87522dcde7985314b5fe4ac808e044a38f0f6a549a793a1f91ec1c7c9991f7e6
#. default-sha256: b90e569d8f4a47b26a95855d9c67c26f65ed3426500b434b9493b268d67708c2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I rubbed it with my sleeve until my skin was bright red. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted to feel something "
"else—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫anything else—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫even pain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perciò la strofinai con la manica finché la pelle non mi diventò rossa. ⟪k:1⟫Volevo provare "
"qualcos’altro—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫qualsiasi altra cosa—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫anche dolore."

#: scenario7:scenario7_840FE672_9342_4BE1_B72F_036C961B64E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ed574f1e64aa9f60c570deaf09cb69dc1fa5074e6b82ac8fa8cd81e517d73e6
#. default-sha256: 1b4b8298be8fcc78847cc611e89833738ab64053f65a0bb19e9d665c0ff6b6a4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_840FE672_9342_4BE1_B72F_036C961B64E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was angry, and I had every right to be."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ero furiosa, e avevo tutte le ragioni per esserlo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90B3244D_6CD4_441B_951E_F0577BDA53D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7567ae12d394aee50b5504d91d6a245b42584544f58a99d7139ce4a271e6856
#. default-sha256: b7c248d200bc73b9c386cdcff3d23851d56b46147778d2ef434816cb854f3357
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90B3244D_6CD4_441B_951E_F0577BDA53D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had not performed the ⟪k:1⟫proper⟪k:2⟫ greeting.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Even in jest, he had no "
"business ⟪k:5⟫actually⟪k:6⟫ putting his lips on my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non aveva eseguito il saluto ⟪k:1⟫corretto⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫ Non aveva il diritto di poggiare le "
"labbra ⟪k:4⟫per davvero⟪k:5⟫, nemmeno per scherzo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_698A0752_EF9B_41D6_9EE7_5F5A9FC921B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e405df47c736487f9ea1254e6e1200e03e21a6de525963c6c688b5df912fb3a4
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_698A0752_EF9B_41D6_9EE7_5F5A9FC921B1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_87EC99C0_B5CC_4789_AC25_1ED76DE8EE20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d521cb2519f6a5307055d64b77661a31b3e351b501d84ef5f75dd2e0d81fbdf7
#. default-sha256: 890e19591d0c5ac8140e035140ec1cf8e765d6cdae6f6a87fe47e223132a49f1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_87EC99C0_B5CC_4789_AC25_1ED76DE8EE20"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Was I angry that he had been disrespectful?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Ero furiosa perché era stato irrispettoso?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_13D0B143_FC01_4D28_9257_7C5A908C7677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 089a98b7bc57dcb4709b89a745e1811438f4a0829706964e0e967f9660847d32
#. default-sha256: f0f04c711f011a8a9874adb15a2c6bd6b568ea1a0eb6f41a83310b961977028e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_13D0B143_FC01_4D28_9257_7C5A908C7677"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_31BF33E2_D49F_45A8_A17E_7D56B1A59EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2ecfe0b155cb5ec20cf21d505b3aabe615fc7566737eec25bc45728d507e200
#. default-sha256: 6f6ae4fc2c9defb7c375e7924a10ae4a95496daf6f50a433d077bd1be0e95e10
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_31BF33E2_D49F_45A8_A17E_7D56B1A59EDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the sound of his voice, I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫couldn’t turn back."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Al suono della sua voce, io—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non riuscii a voltarmi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FBCB4019_C1E7_48D3_9B6E_78CE22099E33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6aeb2b031d19871f92019b16b453c797c258062874fb558865dea83a94c3739a
#. default-sha256: d197d574d35b11d3c40a59d7ae57c685e2b581a0d250373196ea20318edafd3c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FBCB4019_C1E7_48D3_9B6E_78CE22099E33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What the hell are you doing?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Che diavolo stai facendo?!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_995A4CD0_08D4_48CE_9960_87C12920C761
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 181e10ef8d469788a97ddd07196df038c3b86c4e8fc297c0d3ac59fca56a3980
#. default-sha256: 800e064e608ebfbe085a685600b865f96c80a67575ef6f54b25b20ccba265c1c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_995A4CD0_08D4_48CE_9960_87C12920C761"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I tried a second time to get away from him, and that was when reality sunk in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tentai una seconda volta di fuggire via da lui, e fu allora che mi resi conto della realtà."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6DEC0842_64FA_4D3B_B79D_8B67D9518F68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 525edf9f8954e8b498eb519346b8531642cce99ea405e9552e556b47745fd2dc
#. default-sha256: d958210618f495a760f891497c2ca8c9381b43a07aa2c50cee939593a76971f8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6DEC0842_64FA_4D3B_B79D_8B67D9518F68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’ve got a tongue like a boy, milady.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I know some people’re fond o’ that "
"these days.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Can’t say I mind, m’self."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hai la lingua di un ragazzo, milady.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma c’è gente a cui questa cosa piace, di "
"questi tempi.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Personalmente, non posso dire che mi dispiaccia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87da2d5f2e46ad40508c96fa5151e3815d15061ca71d06c4b780a206159a1f0a
#. default-sha256: 5b338070ac6fd6a2cc4838d2bb3a48c861de1ecac5a2d9866e448f74d7304e5e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I have to get stuck with this body?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché dovevo rimanere intrappolata in quel corpo?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BB334368_EA29_49F2_BBE4_C5C688AFB3B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b1f287cd3927f2d22d0aae3a41adee88a18cfc493565d322fd21147d62bcf8d
#. default-sha256: 79cf3ce2d67a14a8554eb0ef517236c06f676db024c33e9331e56f7376036f02
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BB334368_EA29_49F2_BBE4_C5C688AFB3B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, just so we’re clear, I’m not going to hurt you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m no monster—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"promise you that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tanto per essere chiari, non ti farò del male.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non sono un mostro—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫questo "
"te lo assicuro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_29DFBE46_F500_4AC9_810B_EB3F12314404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdcad2eaaee244959d0b4935781e62d55b2f78e73427306546745316c683c410
#. default-sha256: f63684db3999fcc847b75f927cb9dfe929bfdee3db24872183fb2a54b2f6823b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_29DFBE46_F500_4AC9_810B_EB3F12314404"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then why are you holding me against the wall?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Allora perché mi stai spingendo contro il muro?!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_272A67D3_F4A5_4706_89C4_A55D0E0C478E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 994bbaa863d17d7cd23567efdb2739d0ff0e7aed4e63a31880bb58e170d33812
#. default-sha256: ec154a4283509489174d25aa2470ab2d37121efee9bad1f808fc23d9ea8d28c2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_272A67D3_F4A5_4706_89C4_A55D0E0C478E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if I do that, you’ll run away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it’s my personal rule to never let go of "
"anything I like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma se ti lascio, scapperai via.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E la mia regola è “non lasciar andare ciò che ti "
"piace”."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1B719745_4C01_42EC_881F_865A27C78D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a636d996aec93999ca9bd729e39fc514bb1d47b023f445b708d3d561ce5285d
#. default-sha256: bb8c1d9910314406978399951137f45aedebde3f7b8b0c8ff808b3746d79280b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1B719745_4C01_42EC_881F_865A27C78D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your brother says you can’t go outside, so if I set you loose now,⟪k:1⟫I might never get a "
"chance to catch you again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuo fratello dice che non puoi uscire di casa, quindi se ti lascio andare adesso, potrei non "
"avere più la possibilità di acciuffarti di nuovo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B1EBFCD3_AEE4_47BA_A33C_20B008897DA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60926fc8895312917f154c793a9a19d48b2a1d8ae0b933e74c239505063b56bc
#. default-sha256: 13f0ad93b7eabc1d27c8796939b121f3bfca77770bad38c21a6e964b165b7fa4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B1EBFCD3_AEE4_47BA_A33C_20B008897DA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Besides, I’m a minstrel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Spend some time with me, and I’ll write you all the songs "
"you could possibly want."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inoltre, sono un menestrello.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Trascorri del tempo con me, e scriverò per te tutte "
"le canzoni che desideri."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D247F410_D567_41F1_90BE_AC300EED08FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 634236ceebb6ae1ec30af9470fd8853e63387c9e8711df13bd2b5bc2bacf64b4
#. default-sha256: 10aac426925a525f0532e3439cd4e1fce423e0e9e939a12baffdb2ff182a32d7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D247F410_D567_41F1_90BE_AC300EED08FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫With a muse like that, I could write the most incredible songs you’ve ever heard."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Con una musa simile, potrei scrivere le canzoni più incredibili che tu abbia mai ascoltato."

#: scenario7:scenario7_48CDC704_7A4F_428A_B1BC_99C9404AF688
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f20e65b28336a09f1e5453c3e1b3684371cb863a31ac85f7c62fa02bd782ea27
#. default-sha256: 68f5ede2a1c3a4352bf728ef6d94f0f47acc62028d6f750eeed8f8278f1392a1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_48CDC704_7A4F_428A_B1BC_99C9404AF688"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Huh... ⟪k:1⟫That’s odd.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That one’s never failed me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫Che strano.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Questa cosa ha sempre funzionato."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5165BADF_6DF9_4E4E_9596_C0098CB4B5AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba84a13bc97d64c090f69b7a7f086fd49bd34fbeab3ed1488f8cf5a0e06e409b
#. default-sha256: 528ab57f5cb07282048f390164687c3573182c5931bb7870c6d1d3e5eb4658af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5165BADF_6DF9_4E4E_9596_C0098CB4B5AD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man brought his face in just inches from mine and peered into my eyes. ⟪k:1⟫I could feel "
"his hot, wine-stenched breath against my cheeks."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’uomo portò la sua faccia a pochi centimetri dalla mia e mi scrutò negli occhi. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Riuscivo a sentire il suo alito caldo e puzzolente di vino sulle mie guance."

#: scenario7:scenario7_42D9CCE6_AF58_4433_9E36_AD707DB80A34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c57369499721a42735118818b9c2cdc27b57655745417880e0f0a9bcd9b592c
#. default-sha256: 10ebd5bfcd1bb8dd533aab2774e1cd5ef688571ed35405b3b7aeaa965629911a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_42D9CCE6_AF58_4433_9E36_AD707DB80A34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You will be soon enough, darling.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’ve simply never known a man’s touch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lo sarai molto presto, tesoro.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Semplicemente non hai mai conosciuto il tocco di un "
"uomo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_458378D7_E0CD_4771_BA3E_28BD945FECB0
